#: ../guide/plot.md:1 f99ca917268d4e23a2c454c94ac786b6
msgid "Reading the Bokeh report"
msgstr "解读 Bokeh 报告"

#: ../guide/plot.md:3 785f9d1ca4d74959bf4bcd526e7e9b34
msgid ""
"`Backtest.plot()` (and `TradingEnv.plot()`) renders an interactive Bokeh "
"report combining equity, trade returns, and per-asset OHLC panels. This "
"page explains what each panel shows and how to interpret it."
msgstr ""
"`Backtest.plot()`（以及 `TradingEnv.plot()`）渲染一份交互式 Bokeh 报告，"
"包含净值、交易收益、按资产分的 OHLC 面板。本页解释每个面板展示什么、怎么读。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:8 9228e3b8243b476c98bfebed8abf9b0e
msgid "Saving to file"
msgstr "保存到文件"

#: ../guide/plot.md:10 4039c71148424a2b86d03125d4b6567b
msgid ""
"By default `plot()` calls `bokeh.io.show()` which opens the report in a "
"browser. To save a self-contained HTML for sharing or archiving:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下 `plot()` 调用 `bokeh.io.show()` 在浏览器打开报告。"
"如需保存为自包含 HTML 文件用于分享或存档："

#: ../guide/plot.md:18 d0c3cbcf890147a0b7130fb12581d834
msgid ""
"The HTML has all data inlined — no Bokeh server, no external assets. "
"Email it, commit it, drop it in a wiki."
msgstr ""
"HTML 内联所有数据 —— 不需要 Bokeh 服务器、没有外部资源。"
"可以邮件发送、提交进 git、放进 wiki。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:21 d3c30266718340eebcbe5b718111f41d
msgid "Single-asset layout"
msgstr "单资产布局"

#: ../guide/plot.md:23 284f545a7f3548d1b6317cf8bf637627
msgid "Three stacked panels with linked x-axes:"
msgstr "三个 X 轴联动的纵向堆叠面板："

#: ../guide/plot.md:38 d3b08f59f43c4eecb214b3b536d2366b
msgid "Top: Equity panel"
msgstr "顶部：净值面板"

#: ../guide/plot.md:40 0bc3010c965a4090b14fd09a757f069e
msgid ""
"**Solid blue line**: portfolio equity (cumulative returns, normalized to "
"1.0 at the start)."
msgstr ""
"**蓝色实线**：组合净值（累计收益，起点归一化为 1.0）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:42 e2643ca75ee44d0cae022065ca507cd1
msgid "**Gray dotted line**: Buy & Hold returns on the same scale."
msgstr "**灰色虚线**：同尺度下的 Buy & Hold 收益。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:43 95892bb89dac4295ac7f72be25446afd
msgid "**Purple dot**: peak equity point."
msgstr "**紫色点**：净值峰值点。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:44 41042eff1b504ac9839d6cefb4878cce
msgid "**Blue dot**: final equity point (legend shows the final pct)."
msgstr "**蓝色点**：最终净值点（图例显示最终百分比）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:45 2b74e3753b0841e3994e13f73846a3b8
msgid "**Gray dot**: final B&H point."
msgstr "**灰色点**：最终 Buy & Hold 点。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:46 553c68e118a44f09855aff5f473753c4
msgid "**Red dot**: max drawdown trough."
msgstr "**红色点**：最大回撤的谷底。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:47 7d25487a4cc24482b77c5cb38e86e985
msgid ""
"**Red shaded area**: the drawdown region (gap between equity and its "
"running max)."
msgstr ""
"**红色阴影区**：回撤区域（净值与其滚动最大值的差距）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:49 2660c859656e4e7eb7f953a7349dfd15
msgid "**Red horizontal segment**: the longest drawdown duration."
msgstr "**红色水平线段**：最长回撤持续时间。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:51 ../guide/plot.md:69 ../guide/plot.md:90
#: 720249f646b74f0bbd7d07850f411818 a79e2a3309c54a6881d2af8bb64eb876
#: f1a672a33bf045f1b8da9ddd2f28ce58
msgid "What to look for:"
msgstr "重点观察："

#: ../guide/plot.md:53 91dc11baa63b49f6bc1e5bf6820c47b7
msgid "Is the blue line above the gray? You're beating Buy & Hold."
msgstr "蓝线是否在灰线之上？是的话你跑赢 Buy & Hold。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:54 5e7438dfa93144ffb37d4edfd424c21a
msgid ""
"How \"smooth\" is the blue line vs gray? Smoother = lower volatility = "
"better risk-adjusted return (the Sharpe story)."
msgstr ""
"蓝线 vs 灰线哪个更「平滑」？更平滑 = 波动率更低 = 风险调整后收益更好（即 Sharpe）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:56 fecbd39d602542739c9bc41e9ce06527
msgid ""
"Is the red shaded area concentrated in one period or spread out? "
"Concentrated = strategy has one weak regime; spread out = systemic drag."
msgstr ""
"红色阴影区集中在某段时间还是分散？集中 = 策略在某个 regime 失效；"
"分散 = 系统性拖累。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:60 ac98700d321d47868a27320cb1b9b2e6
msgid "Middle: Trade returns"
msgstr "中部：交易收益"

#: ../guide/plot.md:62 408aae07d683497cbca22140615b78d5
msgid "A scatter of every closed trade plotted at its exit time:"
msgstr "每笔已平仓交易绘制在其平仓时间点的散点图："

#: ../guide/plot.md:64 e6d68f5f7789422c8bc0b9417fe9f953
msgid "**Green up-triangles**: long trades. y-axis is `(exit/entry − 1)`."
msgstr "**绿色向上三角**：多头交易。Y 轴是 `(exit/entry − 1)`。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:65 8a5f0e0a46ec48708875efa5fa22ba85
msgid "**Red down-triangles**: short trades. y-axis is the equivalent for shorts."
msgstr "**红色向下三角**：空头交易。Y 轴是对应空头的等价表达式。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:66 73bdd64721364624a76059edf6914587
msgid "**Marker size**: scaled to position size (bigger = larger trade)."
msgstr "**标记大小**：按仓位 size 缩放（越大 = 仓位越大）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:67 64af8266fe7b4f3fbf5936e4b604b626
msgid "**Dashed horizontal at 0**: break-even line."
msgstr "**0 处的水平虚线**：盈亏平衡线。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:71 57a801a462464646bad3c739da8ea9bf
msgid "Are most markers above the 0-line? That's your win rate eyeballed."
msgstr "大多数标记是否在 0 线之上？这就是肉眼估算的胜率。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:72 59ca334c674e46eca3a6e5efa017cde0
msgid ""
"Is there a cluster of large-magnitude losses (way below 0)? That's where "
"stop-losses (or lack thereof) hurt."
msgstr ""
"是否有一簇深亏（远低于 0）？那里就是止损（或缺少止损）出问题的地方。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:74 0074bdcb51044100872bb7f83b5aee44
msgid ""
"Are big winners and big losers symmetric around 0? Asymmetric is good — "
"small losses + large gains is the trend-following sweet spot."
msgstr ""
"大赢家和大输家围绕 0 是否对称？非对称才好 —— 小亏 + 大赚是趋势跟随的甜区。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:77 1d27b3ba283b4015907a964d8f2f300b
msgid "Bottom: OHLC + volume + trade boxes"
msgstr "底部：OHLC + 成交量 + 交易框"

#: ../guide/plot.md:79 1c4ee5dc4c9b44119a7d0d298695d53c
msgid "The price action with overlays:"
msgstr "价格走势叠加多种标记："

#: ../guide/plot.md:81 a00410852d4e412f9ee58903442b285a
msgid "**Black line**: closing prices."
msgstr "**黑线**：收盘价。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:82 e6bbce283ca04d41869b8e4d33b54c30
msgid ""
"**Bottom bars (faint green/red)**: volume (right y-axis), color-coded by "
"close ≥/< open."
msgstr ""
"**底部柱状（淡绿 / 淡红）**：成交量（右 Y 轴），按 close ≥/< open 着色。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:84 507c00814d60467795b5cb0a2afaae0e
msgid ""
"**Translucent green rectangles**: winning trades — left/right edges are "
"entry/exit times, top/bottom are entry/exit prices."
msgstr ""
"**半透明绿色矩形**：盈利交易 —— 左右边是开仓 / 平仓时间，上下边是开仓 / 平仓价格。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:86 eb6304e58921449c897620c970fadcea
msgid "**Translucent red rectangles**: losing trades, same convention."
msgstr "**半透明红色矩形**：亏损交易，约定相同。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:87 92833cc10f334556bd6398acc4fb52ac
msgid ""
"**Triangle markers**: order fills. Up = buy; down = sell. Size scaled to "
"order magnitude."
msgstr ""
"**三角标记**：订单成交。向上 = 买；向下 = 卖。大小按订单规模缩放。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:92 ebc0984e23d34bec811d679c3f8e57eb
msgid ""
"Trade boxes that span long horizontal stretches = you held through noise."
" Short stretches = quick in-out trades."
msgstr ""
"横跨很长水平区间的交易框 = 你扛过了噪声。短区间 = 快进快出。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:94 8f6023c3df7a4db7af60dcd49d789ee5
msgid ""
"Buy markers at local highs / sell markers at local lows = bad timing, "
"possibly a sign of late signal generation."
msgstr ""
"买点在局部高点 / 卖点在局部低点 = 时机不好，可能是信号生成滞后。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:96 30fb6ec280f74a5d96700972d9f441c3
msgid ""
"Boxes piling up densely = high turnover. Watch the `Total Commission "
"Cost` metric in `show_stats()`."
msgstr ""
"交易框密集堆叠 = 高换手。注意 `show_stats()` 中的 `Total Commission Cost` 指标。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:99 0a259ddb8cf647a49fe44567791f8292
msgid "Multi-asset layout"
msgstr "多资产布局"

#: ../guide/plot.md:101 d1b4fb9a6ec44a59a325cec1b65da792
msgid ""
"The report adds one OHLC panel per asset, all stacked, all sharing the "
"same x-axis:"
msgstr ""
"报告为每个资产添加一个 OHLC 面板，全部堆叠并共享同一 X 轴："

#: ../guide/plot.md:118 6cf737c7c7c94faeb305e67274d0caa6
msgid ""
"Each per-asset OHLC panel shows trades and orders **filtered to that "
"asset only**, so you can see exactly when the strategy moved in each "
"name. The equity panel up top is portfolio-level (one curve, summing "
"across all assets)."
msgstr ""
"每个资产的 OHLC 面板只显示**该资产**的交易和订单，所以你能精确看到策略在每个标的上"
"的动作。顶部净值面板是组合级别的（一条曲线，跨资产汇总）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:123 7f1b2e68317c4028b3da59e74a1ef288
msgid ""
"The Buy & Hold benchmark is the **equal-weighted average** of each "
"asset's first-to-last return — a fair \"naive portfolio\" comparison."
msgstr ""
"Buy & Hold 基准是各资产首尾收益的**等权平均** —— 一个公平的「朴素组合」对照。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:126 2dbb53ec380c4681bde7252ccc94ca44
msgid "Interactive features"
msgstr "交互特性"

#: ../guide/plot.md:128 1b2f257197544993a09424206d8773fc
msgid "**Drag the x-axis** on any panel to pan; **scroll** to zoom."
msgstr "在任意面板**拖动 X 轴**平移；**滚轮**缩放。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:129 c7f7c4caba674eddba57815aaaaa745e
msgid "**Click a legend entry** to toggle that series on/off."
msgstr "**点击图例项**切换该系列显示 / 隐藏。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:130 b2555edbed4c4c6cbcec662a6773e275
msgid "**Hover** for tooltips: dates, prices, returns, profit per trade."
msgstr "**悬停**显示 tooltip：日期、价格、收益、单笔盈亏。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:131 a3e666745f79455ba8fadaeaf81ba2ad
msgid ""
"**Auto-rescaling**: zooming the x-axis triggers a JS callback that "
"rescales the y-axes for the visible range only (single-asset layout)."
msgstr ""
"**自动缩放**：缩放 X 轴会触发 JS 回调，只对可见范围重新缩放 Y 轴（单资产布局下）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:134 0355491c7ebf4f0092595a791754ac3b
msgid "Common surprises"
msgstr "常见困惑"

#: ../guide/plot.md:136 e034e5ec12ff42f6939777db78b1adbc
msgid ""
"**Trade-return scatter looks empty**: the strategy hasn't closed any "
"trades yet. SL/TP not triggered + no signal exits = no closed trades."
msgstr ""
"**交易收益散点图是空的**：策略还没平仓。SL/TP 未触发 + 没有信号平仓 = 没有平仓交易。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:138 e12bcf2fc0104da88cdea1c7188ac5b3
msgid ""
"**OHLC shows a gap at the end with no buy/sell**: the "
"`close_all_positions()` end-of-run sweep records exits at the last bar's "
"close, which can produce a flurry of markers right at the right edge."
msgstr ""
"**OHLC 末端有一段没有买卖标记**：`close_all_positions()` 在结束时的统一清仓"
"使用最后一根 bar 的 close 价记录退出，可能在右边缘产生一堆密集标记。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:142 630f191dfb7f4e7391a2dd17cd101cc0
msgid ""
"**Volume is missing**: your input data didn't have a `Volume` column. Add"
" one (or accept volume bars don't show)."
msgstr ""
"**没有成交量**：你的输入数据没有 `Volume` 列。加一列（或接受没有成交量条）。"

#: ../guide/plot.md:144 e0e345bff03d460faeb5053e4d5c798c
msgid ""
"**Equity line drops sharply with no visible trade**: you took a large "
"mark-to-market loss without exiting. Check `unrealized_pnl` in your "
"strategy logic."
msgstr ""
"**净值线骤降但看不到对应交易**：你扛了一笔很大的浮亏但没平仓。"
"检查策略逻辑里的 `unrealized_pnl`。"
